u decide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break Shield Turn-Based Combat: The battle system is rooted in classic turn-based mechanics, but with a twist; turns aren't set in stone. You\u2019ll need to discover enemy weaknesses, break their shields, and deliver the finishing blow, inspired by the Octopath Traveler system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Boss Battles: Every boss has a perfect strategy waiting to be uncovered, rewarding careful observation and tactical thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/03ded6b828e070d17f76241f978b2339.poster.avif?t=1765210313\" width=708 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/03ded6b828e070d17f76241f978b2339.webm?t=1765210313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/03ded6b828e070d17f76241f978b2339.mp4?t=1765210313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flexible Character Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A job point system lets you unlock skills in any order, creating countless builds and party combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every hero - from magic-focused mages to battle-hardened warriors - and define your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/b7b839638ff85e4fbd87a58f929e43c8.avif?t=1765210313\" width=1209 height=677 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204240/extras/f51119